[For "white"]
[Kind "sideline"]
[Start "london-c5-2 3.e3"]
[Name "...c5 on move two: Black takes"]

3... cxd4
4. exd4 { Takes with the e-pawn. The queen stays safe at home, and the e-file opens. }
4... Nc6
5. c3 { Guards d4 and takes b4 away from the knight. White's pawns stand on c3 and d4, with the f4 bishop outside them. }
5... Nf6
6. Nf3 { Then Bd3, castling and Nbd2, the usual set-up with the e-pawn gone. } *
